ntainsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048418436810985472,"date":1538797408000,"rawContent":"When we pitched stories of sexual harassment at OPEN magazine\nEditor: When will Feminism 2.0 happen?\nManaging ed: God, now everyone will pitch stories about how they were abused *groan*\nDeputy ed: Flirting is not harassment. It's so stupid if you complain about everything #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048420000585932800,"date":1538797781000,"rawContent":"When we pitched stories of sexual violence: Please, no more #tearjerkers. These things keep happening. It's so boring #rapes #Dalits #Adivasis #Kashmir same old same old\nWe need to have other types of stories. Affluent stories. Pages need to look good. #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048421675036028928,"date":1538798180000,"rawContent":"\"As a society we are shaken only when a girl's intestines come out...\"\nYday I read @Raksha_Kumar 's essay years after it was published. This is exactly what is normalised in edit meetings like in OPEN. Is it horrible enough to pitch a story about? #MeToo\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/zfKBIUp72a","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048422455004606465,"date":1538798366000,"rawContent":"What does that do to us as persons? When someone randomly, gratuitously brings sex into a conversation, I think perhaps this is normal. I am the prude\nWhen someone grabs me, I think why do I get so flustered? I should develop a sense of enjoying myself #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048423783986548736,"date":1538798683000,"rawContent":"Worst perhaps for us journalists, is that it makes us doubt violations, encounters, incidents that we should be reporting as journalists. Because we are measuring it up in our heads before we pitch it in the edit meets: is this horrible enough to be a story? #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048426522598625280,"date":1538799336000,"rawContent":"I can think of so many good stories that we didn't investigate at all because we asked: \n\"is it horrible enough?\" \n\"is it a tearjerker?\" \n\"is it boring?\"\nThis framing is rape culture too. We fail professionally when we work in rape culture #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048427929494048769,"date":1538799671000,"rawContent":"And these stories will be boring. The pages won't look good. Stories of power and abuse are boring because they happen again and again and again\nWe have to find ways to make it read well, look good on the pages. You editors have to step up. Stop being lazy and bored #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1048431404726538240,"date":1538800500000,"rawContent":"I understand stories need perspective. The so-called editorial input, intervention. \nFraming stories of sexual harassment, sexual violence as 'boring' + 'tearjerkers' + 'pages will not look good' is not editorial perspective. It's rape culture #MeToo","userId":54892886,"media":null,"username":"sohinichat","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"r